  "title": "Del Webb Announces First Active Adult Community in Bridgeland®",
  "summary": "Del Webb, America’s leading builder of active adult communities for those 55+, today announced Del Webb Bridgeland, a new 190-acre community planned for Bridgeland, the 11,500-acre master planned community in northwest Houston developed by Howard Hughes Communities™. Del Webb Bridgeland will be the first active adult community in Bridgeland,...",
